### PHØNIX API — open with the "REST Client" extension and click "Send Request"
@host = http://localhost:3001
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### API index
GET {{host}}/api/v1

### Register (copy accessToken from the response into @token above)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "you@example.com", "username": "you", "password": "strongpass123", "displayName": "You" }

### Sign in
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "you@example.com", "password": "strongpass123" }

### Me
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Available tools
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tools
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Run the calculator tool
POST {{host}}/api/v1/tools/calculator/execute
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "input": { "expression": "(1234*5.5)/3" } }
